{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "eptms-api-v1-collection",
    "name": "EPTMS – Employee Project & Task Management System API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the EPTMS backend. \n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection into Postman.\n2. Create an Environment with:\n   - `base_url` = `http://localhost:5000/api/v1`\n   - `token` = (auto-populated on login)\n   - `admin_token` = (auto-populated on admin login)\n3. Run **Auth → Login** first to populate the token automatically.\n\n## Authentication\nAll endpoints (except Login and Health) require `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\nThe Login request includes a **Test script** that automatically stores the JWT token in the `token` environment variable.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",    "value": "http://localhost:5000/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token",       "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health",
            "description": "Check API and database health status. No authentication required."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "const res = pm.response.json();",
                "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.token) {",
                "  pm.environment.set('token', res.data.token);",
                "  pm.environment.set('admin_token', res.data.token);",
                "  console.log('✅ JWT token stored in environment.');",
                "}"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\": \"admin@eptms.com\", \"password\": \"Password123!\"}"
            },
            "description": "Authenticate as Administrator. JWT token is automatically stored in environment variables."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Project Manager)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": ["const r = pm.response.json(); if(r.success && r.data) pm.environment.set('token', r.data.token);"],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"email\": \"s.connor@eptms.com\", \"password\": \"Password123!\"}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/change-password",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"currentPassword\": \"Password123!\", \"newPassword\": \"NewPassword456!\"}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Employees",
      "item": [
        { "name": "List Employees", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/employees?page=1&limit=20", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }] } },
        { "name": "Get Employee by ID", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/employees/1", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }] } },
        {
          "name": "Create Employee",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "url": "{{base_url}}/employees",
